        ('/**\n     * Returns the maximum observation added to the sketch,\n     * or {@code NaN} if the sketch is empty.\n     * <p>\n     * Equivalent to {@code TDIGEST.MAX key}.\n     *\n     * @return maximum observation\n     */', '/**\n     * 返回草图中的最大观测值；草图为空时返回 {@code NaN}。\n     * <p>\n     * Equivalent to {@code TDIGEST.MAX key}.\n     *\n     * @return 最大观测值\n     */'),
